WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:05.360
Kaito said... Kaito said that I'm the only one in his eyes.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:10.070
Compared to the mermaid in his memories, he said that the one he likes is me.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.280
I'm so happy.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.990
Even though Kaito has already departed for Hawaii,

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.490
I won't waver any more.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.580
I'll believe in him.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:25.000
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.950
Everyone's gathered, right?

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:11.140
I have an important announcement to make.

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:13.810
Wait a moment, Hanon-san.

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.660
Lucia-san isn't here.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:16.870
Lucia-sa-

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:18.250
Shh!

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.490
It's better if Lucia isn't here!

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:20.850
Listen up.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:25.090
Starting today, use of the words "Kaito" and "Hawaii" are prohibited.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:26.920
Kaito and Hawaii?

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:31.160
Don't mention those words in front of Lucia!

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.500
I see. Understood.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.310
Kinda like how, for students at exam time, the words "fail" and "flunk" are taboo to them.

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:43.400
It's also like repeatedly saying "leave" and "break up" during a wedding ceremony, which is quite the taboo.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.170
Do you understand, Hippo?

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:45.720
Roger!

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.890
Hey, everyone! Make way, make way!

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:50.750
Lucia, you're going to wash all those clothes?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.670
Yeah, since it's such great weather outside!

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:56.090
These should dry well and pick up the scent of the sun-

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.320
Owww!

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:04.650
Dark Invitation.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.090
Are you all right, Lucia-san?

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:15.590
Here, use this to ease the swelling.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.120
No...

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.820
That's one big lump.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:20.880
Impressive.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.790
Now I won't be able to leave the house like this...

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.560
It's all right, Lucia.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.180
It's not that big, so I don't think anyone will notice.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.080
That's right.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.010
Kaito won't notice it, either.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:32.590
Rina!

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:33.810
Ahh, oops!

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.250
I guess that's true.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.230
Kaito won't notice it.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:44.000
Hey, Rina! Didn't I just tell you that saying "Kaito" and "Hawaii" in front of Lucia is prohibited?

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.910
S-Sorry. My mistake.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.490
Good afternoon! You have air mail!

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:58.750
I knew it, it's addressed to me! A letter from Hawaii!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.880
Kaito!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.940
Let's see here...

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.450
"Lucia, are you doing well?"

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:13.990
Yeah, definitely!

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.500
"I'm doing well, too."

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.910
"Over here, I'm riding the waves every day."

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.110
The waves in Hawaii are amazing.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.770
There really is a Big Wave!

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:24.280
Through surfing, I have made many friends.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.440
That must be a letter from Kaito, huh?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.970
I wonder what he wrote...

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.970
Spying on her makes me want to read it!

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:39.350
Lucia-san has totally forgotten about her lump, too.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:45.030
Also, whenever we greet or part here, we say "Aloha!"

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:46.680
Quite educational, huh?

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.510
Well then, I'll write another letter to you sometime.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.110
Aloha, Lucia!

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:51.310
Love Kaito.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.760
"Aloha, Lucia!"...?

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.890
W-Wait, is this it!?

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.090
Doesn't he have other things to tell me?

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:01.730
Something like "I want to see you now" or "without you, I'm lonely."

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.690
Not just filling this letter with memories of Hawaii...

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.850
Kaito...

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:34.040
Mitsuki, I won't forgive you.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.950
Sara!

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.880
Where are you, Sara!?

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:45.860
Gaito-sama, who is this "Sara" you're talking about?

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.170
It's none of your concern!

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:50.860
Gaito-sama...

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:52.600
He seems to have lost his composure.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.280
How true.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.370
Just who on earth is this "Sara?"

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:04.300
Sara, there's a person on the surface who's captured your heart and doesn't want to let it go.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.760
Who exactly is he?

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:09.250
Sara, I don't want to let go of your hand!

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.560
I don't want to live in solitude any more.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.640
I've had enough.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.100
For that, I have to...

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:23.480
Before you become one with that person, I have to gain power quickly...

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.010
Arise from your slumber, my other self!

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:40.290
Taking a shower after surfing really is the best.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:49.720
Arise from your slumber, my other self!

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:52.800
Y-You are...!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:56.640
Have you decided what is most precious to you?

00:06:57.190 --> 00:07:00.690
Yeah, you don't have to tell me. I've already decided.

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:03.510
Is this the one?

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.230
Lucia!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.620
Why didn't you protect what is most precious to you?

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:10.760
What!?

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:11.660
What do you mean?

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.020
Leaving your dearest far away...

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:16.760
Are you even protecting her at all?

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.480
Stop that!

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:21.470
Don't you dare touch Lucia!

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:23.640
Do you want power?

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.990
Power to protect what's most important to you.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.630
Lucia!!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.050
You do' want power, don't you?

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.050
You do' want power, don't you?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.460
The power to protect what's precious to you.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:35.230
If you want it, come to my side.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.380
Before you lose everything...

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:47.170
Who... am' I?

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:47.170
Who... am' I?

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.490
I want your power.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.410
Hurry and awaken from your slumber, my other self.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.250
This place is like the color of the sea at twilight.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:14.920
Mitsuki, do you remember those beautiful days?

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.060
Of course, Sara!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.140
I've wanted to see you.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:34.290
However, you've shattered that once-beautiful melody of ours...

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.070
Sara...

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:39.540
Deep sadness has ripped my heart to pieces.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.030
As for myself... I...

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.370
What about the mission of the Mermaid Princesses!?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:49.130
Why do we have to break up because of that!?

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:53.570
I didn't choose to become a Mermaid Princess!

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:05.650
I destroyed that beautiful kingdom with my own hands!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:06.630
Sara!

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:10.580
Sara...

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:14.070
So that sadness has stained your hair black?

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:17.490
Mitsuki, I lost everything.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:18.700
Sara.

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.660
This is an invitation to the Yamifukai Kingdom.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:26.420
However, you won't be able to return to the surface again.

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:31.370
I'll be waiting to see if you have the courage to find me.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:35.970
Sara.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.770
Lucia is really late.

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:43.850
What is she doing?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.270
Do you want to call her over?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:45.850
Yeah.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:57.010
Kaito, I want you at my side.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.040
Lucia.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.960
Hanon, Rina.

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.080
Cheer up, now!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.800
We're together with you now, right?

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.920
That's right, you're not alone!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:16.130
Thanks, Hanon, Rina!

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:20.890
I heard that Mitsuki-sensei handed in his letter of resignation.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.000
Yeah, I heard that he's going far away somewhere for a while.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.250
Letter of resignation?

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.670
Tarou-chan did?

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:28.440
What is going on?

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:36.190
Tarou-chan...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.780
So he's going to quit his job at school...

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:40.960
Say, Rina...

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.410
Mitsuki-sensei's resignation letter...

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:47.860
Could it have something to do with the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess?

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:51.500
Yeah, I'm wondering about that now as well.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:53.700
I hope nothing bad happens.

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:02.960
Hanon-san, Lucia-san, and Rina-san, too.

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:04.640
Did something happen?

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.490
I don't have anything else to offer, so please have some tea.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:20.820
Mitsuki-sensei, about your resignation... have you already decided?

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.390
Where will you be going?

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.970
Tell us where!

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:27.950
Honestly... I'm not too sure myself.

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:32.380
Mitsuki-sensei, what do you mean by that?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:38.840
However, like Hanon-san said, I've decided that I'll be going away no matter what.

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.130
Mitsuki-sensei.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:44.620
I believe that the seahorse will guide me to my future.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.340
The seahorse?

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.770
For what reason?

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.660
Well...

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.190
Could it be for someone else's sake?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.200
Hanon-san.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:12:00.240
Suppose... you have a loved one who was hurt because of you. What would you do?

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.260
Eh?

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.120
Your loved one has lost themselves.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.950
What would you do if that person has to shoulder such a deep sadness?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.040
What?

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.220
What does that mean?

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.120
Mitsuki-sensei, I don't understand!

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:14.870
It's fine if you'll never understand.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.590
You'll be better off that way.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:25.000
Presented by Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:39.510
Hey, Hanon.

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:43.490
Nikora-san wants to clear the table, so she wants you to hurry up and eat your dinner now.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.760
I don't want it.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:45.910
Hanon.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:50.250
I understand your feelings, but would you at least drink some soup?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:58.250
Um... it's time for the Beginner's Happy Grass Skirt Dance!

00:12:58.520 --> 00:12:59.270
Hippo?

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.630
Hawaii~ Hawaii~

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:04.090
Aloha...

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.280
Hippo's grass skirt dance...

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.510
I don't think it resembles the real one...

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:12.770
Speaking of which, Hanon.

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:16.940
I just realized something strange from the talk with Mitsuki-sensei.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.020
What was it?

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:24.320
He said something about "I believe that the seahorse will guide me to my future," right?

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.190
Yeah, he did say that.

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:29.950
After he said that, though, I couldn't follow anymore.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:34.750
He doesn't know where to go, but he said that the seahorse will guide him.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.750
That means Mitsuki-sensei's destination would be...

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.140
In the sea!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:40.930
Yes.

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:44.710
That would mean the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess wants to...

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:46.680
We don't know about that yet.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:48.990
But I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:51.260
Is Mitsuki-sensei in some kind of trouble?

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.420
It must be the Key of Sealing!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:56.430
What, Hippo?

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.230
What's the Key of Sealing?

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:03.500
I want to join you all in finding where Mitsuki-sensei and the seahorse are.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.590
H-Hey!

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:05.500
Hippo!

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:06.530
Oh no!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.410
No, don't worry.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.260
I'm well prepared for the dangers.

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:15.330
To be honest, my duty at the surface is to work together with the Mermaid Princesses—

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.960
Ow, ow ow, ow!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:27.160
Judging by how Mitsuki-sensei was talking earlier...

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.920
... He'll be sure to leave tonight.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.220
Ah, over there!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:43.980
That's certainly the Key of Sealing.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.370
Tarou-chan.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.230
Let's go!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.250
Yeah!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.690
Tarou-chan!

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:11.670
Hanon.

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:13.030
Just be patient.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:19.410
Whether it's the water demons or another mermaid who called Mitsuki-sensei here... we have to find out first!

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:20.270
Yeah.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.720
He seems to be fine in the middle of the sea, though...

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.650
What exactly is that seahorse?

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.070
You girls!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.010
Karen!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.790
I saw a suspicious light here, so I came here.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.290
What exactly is that light?

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.720
Well...

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.750
We don't know, either.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.670
Tarou-chan.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.530
I never would've expected Gaito's lair to be here!

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:54.660
Tarou-chan.

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:56.230
That is...!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:56.930
A mermaid...

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.930
It's the mermaid from that time.

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:12.390
What's she doing? Why is she after Mitsuki-sensei?

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:13.950
Tarou-chan!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:14.720
Hanon!

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:15.200
Wait!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.710
Tarou-chan!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.000
Hanon!!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.290
Are you all right?

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.300
Tarou-chan!

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:24.240
Can't you hear me!?

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.310
Don't go in there!!

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.650
What in the world?

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:33.450
The gate opened!

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:34.630
Tarou-chan, where are you!?

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.590
To think that the Mermaid Princesses would come here to play with us on their own accord.

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:43.810
I'm impressed.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.460
How true.

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:47.510
Want to hear our sincere song?

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:49.600
It's the Black Beauty Sisters!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.690
It's Show Time!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.650
That's the Key of Sealing!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:04.210
I've finally gotten back what's rightfully mine.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:07.000
I wonder just how much effort I put into looking for it...

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:12.220
That is...

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:13.220
Could it be...

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:15.370
Mythical Beast Pardalokampoi!

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:17.650
I never guessed that Hippo was the legendary beast...

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.330
This is my true form.

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:26.900
My duty is to protect every one of the Mermaid Princesses.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.260
Now's our chance! Lucia, Hanon!

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:34.010
Okay!

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.860
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:43.180
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.180
Green Pearl Voice!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:04.950
Your song will be blown away by our Pichi Pichi Voices.

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:06.550
This is bad!

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:09.000
We were distracted by Pardalokampoi!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.170
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.650
Love Shower Pitch!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:21.530
How about an encore?

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.430
Damn you...!

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:26.180
If only Mythical Beast Pardalokampoi hadn't interfered...

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:39.390
Gaito's lair disappeared again.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:40.840
Where's Tarou-chan!?

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:44.010
Tarou-chan! Where are you!?

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.170
Tarou-chan!

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.470
Tarou-chan!!

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:13.980
The death god called "Love" haunts me,

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:17.390
Accusing me that I still love Mitsuki.

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:20.130
No, my anger exceeds my sadness.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.010
Hatred is what I live for!

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:24.370
This is revenge.

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:27.430
Mitsuki, you will live here forever!

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.210
I've been thinking.

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:38.360
That mermaid at the other side of the gate,

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:41.640
Could she be the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess?

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:45.010
Are you saying that she's the mermaid in Tarou-chan's memories?

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:48.000
Well then, why did she treat Tarou-chan like that?

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.400
I don't know about that.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:58.150
Kaito.

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:11.680
That's strange. Nobody's answering.

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:14.060
Did something happen, Lucia?

00:23:50.870 --> 00:23:53.490
Arise from your slumber, my other self!

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.070
Y-You are...

00:23:55.070 --> 00:23:57.830
Why didn't you protect what is most precious to you?

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:01.000
Why do you have to say that to me!?

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:05.090
The power to protect what's most important to you...

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:07.900
Come, my other self!

00:24:07.900 --> 00:24:11.460
If you want that power, come to my side.

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.930
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:14.930 --> 00:24:16.330
Kaito's Nightmare.

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:19.980
Welcome back, my other self.
